        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಗ್ರಹಿಸು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗ್ರಹಿಸು — grahisu — \"to grasp; to comprehend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಗು ಪಾಠವನ್ನು ಬೇಗ ಗ್ರಹಿಸಿತು. magu pāṭhavannu bēga grahisitu. The child grasped the lesson quickly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಗ್ರಹಿಸಿದೆ, grahiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗ್ರಹಿಕೆ, understanding."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗ್ರಹಿಸು (grahisu) is built on Sanskrit grahaṇa, \"seizing, grasping\" (CDIAL 4364), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
